  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be a square matrix of order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Then, the matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
